What was derived:

  dist/font-table.txt

    A lookup table mapping glyph-shape MD5 fingerprints to Chinese characters.
    It is derived from the upstream project's `src/main/resources/font_map_table.json`
    (30884 entries), by:

      1. selecting only the entries that the encryption font encountered in this
         project actually uses (6725 entries);
      2. re-encoding each entry from a JSON key/value pair into a fixed-width
         record of 11 characters — 10 hex digits of the MD5 prefix followed by
         one character — so the whole table can be inlined into a userscript
         without any escaping;
      3. concatenating the records into a single string.

    No other file in this repository is derived from that project. All code in
    src/, build/, tests/ and tools/ was written independently; the upstream
    project is a Java/Spring Boot server, this project is a single-file browser
    userscript.

